  colour: {r: 0.96, g: 0.95, b: 0.88, a: 1}
  description: a note from the chef.
  logText: 'FROM THE CHEF. If a guest asks for a Christmas menu, offer the winter
    menu. Do not say no, and do not say Christmas. Future Day is in February, and
    it is the best night of our year. The private room gets the tasting menu, no
    substitutions.


    By hand under it: Turkey for the caf is in walk-in 2. It
    is for GENE''S BIRTHDAY. Nobody touch it.'
